WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.190 --> 00:00:13.370
[Aerial view of buildings surrounded by trees.]

00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:24.780
[Closer view of buildings including a large smokestack.]

00:00:24.780 --> 00:00:38.520
[Aerial view of many buildings surrounded by hills and trees.]

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:47.980
[Closer view of several buildings.]

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:56.760
[View of a compound of buildings of various sizes.]

00:00:56.760 --> 00:01:01.690
[Far aerial view of buildings with trees in foreground.]

00:01:01.690 --> 00:03:43.700
[Camera pans the area surrounding the buildings from a distance.]

00:03:43.700 --> 00:04:14.930
[View of the buildings from ground level.]

00:04:14.930 --> 00:04:23.850
[View of the grounds and people on a swing.]

00:04:23.850 --> 00:04:27.590
[Trees with people seen walking among them.]

00:04:27.590 --> 00:04:32.730
[Close-up of flowers on a tree.]

00:04:32.730 --> 00:04:43.450
[One of the bigger buildings is shown with people walking into it.]

00:04:43.450 --> 00:04:49.020
[A pickup truck drives by the building.]

00:04:49.020 --> 00:05:04.340
[A structure with floor and roof but no walls is shown.]

00:05:04.340 --> 00:05:27.290
[Camera pans small structures on short stilts and shows two open buildings that are filled with chairs.]

00:05:27.290 --> 00:05:46.600
[A building with a porch is shown. Nurses in uniform are shown descending the front stairs in pairs.]

00:05:46.600 --> 00:05:51.880
[The nurses walk down a pathway and walk in between the trees.]

00:05:51.880 --> 00:06:07.210
[The nurses are shown standing on the front stairs of a building in a group. They are smiling and talking to one another.]

00:06:07.210 --> 00:06:11.870
[A building is shown with people coming out of it.]

00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:16.540
[Close-up of the door of the building. People can be seen inside the building.]

00:06:16.540 --> 00:06:23.140
[Men go into and out of the building. The sign above the door says "Cooperative Store."]

00:06:23.140 --> 00:06:33.270
[The camera pans around the inside of the store.]

00:06:33.270 --> 00:06:38.400
[The outside of a big building is shown.]

00:06:38.400 --> 00:06:44.410
[The outside of a building which has flower vines growing on it is shown.]

00:06:44.410 --> 00:06:51.020
[A fence is shown with a bird on it.]

00:06:51.020 --> 00:07:13.360
[The outside of a bigger building is shown.]

00:07:13.360 --> 00:07:25.530
[Men are shown in a structure with low walls but no roof, lying down, sunbathing and turning over.]

00:07:25.530 --> 00:07:30.330
[Three men are shown standing wearing underwear.]

00:07:30.330 --> 00:07:42.670
[They are laughing and two men playfully hit one another.]

00:07:42.670 --> 00:07:46.930
[The sunbathing men are shown.]

00:07:46.930 --> 00:08:19.040
[Some men are fully dressed and standing.]

00:08:19.040 --> 00:08:25.970
[An attendant fully dressed in white shirt and pants is shown with four men wearing underwear.]

00:08:25.970 --> 00:08:40.100
[The attendant is pointing out something about the men and smiling.]

00:08:40.100 --> 00:08:55.630
[Two of the men change places.]

00:08:55.630 --> 00:09:11.800
[The attendant is shown.]

00:09:11.800 --> 00:09:20.520
[Another attendant is shown standing in a corner of the roofless structure, dressed in all white clothing and wearing a hat.]

00:09:20.520 --> 00:09:28.330
[Men are sitting backwards on chairs outside a building with a nurse watching them.]

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:39.920
[Close-up of a man sitting in a chair. There is a mirror attached to the chair. The man is holding his mouth open and sticking his tongue out. The sun is reflected into his mouth.]

00:09:39.920 --> 00:09:49.640
[The group of men is shown again. The nurse is talking to them.]

00:09:49.640 --> 00:09:54.790
[A building is burning and is completely engulfed in flames. Two people are watching it burn.]

00:09:54.790 --> 00:10:09.270
[Another building next to the burning building is already almost completely burned down.]

00:10:09.270 --> 00:10:18.660
[People are watching the burning building.]

00:10:18.660 --> 00:10:36.100
[Men walk away from the burning building.]

00:10:36.100 --> 00:10:44.600
[A man with a cat next to him is feeding a small deer from his hands.]

00:10:44.600 --> 00:10:50.160
[The deer walks around and a girl walks over to the man and cat.]

00:10:50.160 --> 00:10:54.610
[The girl is shown petting the deer as it licks her dress.]

00:10:54.610 --> 00:11:03.040
[A train is shown coming toward the camera. There are buildings on both sides of the tracks.]

00:11:03.040 --> 00:11:10.790
[There are two cars to the train. It stops in front of the station and men, women and children get off the train.]

00:11:10.790 --> 00:11:20.960
[The train porter helps people off the train.]

00:11:20.960 --> 00:11:40.750
[The people exiting the train walk away from it in front of the station.]

00:11:40.750 --> 00:11:45.120
[Several pickup trucks are shown. They have canvas coverings over the back of the pickup.]

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:49.100
[One truck drives away and there are people seated on benches in the back of it.]

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:52.920
[The trucks back up to steps and people get out of the back.]

00:11:52.920 --> 00:11:57.430
[The people have tags around their necks and many are holding things.]

00:11:57.430 --> 00:12:18.530
[The people, many of them boys, walk away from the truck.]

00:12:18.530 --> 00:12:22.840
[A nurse is sitting at a table with a small boy. She is talking to him and writing. Along the edge of the table are signs with the letters: S, T, U, W, X, Y, Z.]

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:38.330
[Another nurse is sitting behind a table talking to a boy and writing.]

00:12:38.330 --> 00:12:55.380
[A nurse is sitting behind a table with a small boy sitting in a chair in front of her. She is taking his temperature and pulse rate.]

00:12:55.380 --> 00:13:06.680
[The boy stands up and walks away while another small boy gets into the chair.]

00:13:06.680 --> 00:13:25.140
[The nurse also takes the temperature and pulse rate of the second boy who then gets up and walks away.]

00:13:25.140 --> 00:13:27.450
[The nurse talks to the boy and hands him a package.]

00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:32.730
[A woman has a small boy sitting in front of her and she covers his neck and shoulders with cloth.]

00:13:32.730 --> 00:13:56.290
[The woman combs the boy's hair and then gets the clippers and shaves his head.]

00:13:56.290 --> 00:14:00.770
[A room with many sinks is shown filled with boys who are pushing each other as they wash up and brush their teeth.]

00:14:00.770 --> 00:14:24.400
[The boys push each other in fun.]

00:14:24.400 --> 00:14:39.290
[There is one mirror and the boys push each other out of the way trying to use it.]

00:14:39.290 --> 00:14:47.010
[Three boys wearing only underwear are shown.]

00:14:47.010 --> 00:14:55.160
[The boys turn around so their backs are to the camera.]

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:58.440
[Four more boys are shown wearing only underwear and then turn their backs to the camera.]

00:14:58.440 --> 00:15:08.150
[The boys turn around again to face the camera.]

00:15:08.150 --> 00:15:22.710
[Three young girls are shown wearing only underwear. They turn all the way around until they are facing the camera again.]

00:15:22.710 --> 00:15:27.660
[Two older girls face the camera wearing outfits that cover them up on both top and bottom.]

00:15:27.660 --> 00:15:37.830
[The girls turn around and then face the camera again. They then smile.]

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:40.080
[Two young boys wearing underwear are shown smiling.]

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:48.920
[The boys turn alll the way around.]

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:56.650
[Two more boys are shown. One of the boys turns so his back is to the camera. The other boy is turned sideways by a man partially off-camera.]

00:15:56.650 --> 00:16:00.820
[The second boy is then turned so his back is to the camera.]

00:16:00.820 --> 00:16:04.730
[The turn back to face the camera looking at the man off-screen.]

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:17.720
[An older boy wearing underwear turns his back to the camera and then turns back to face the camera.]

00:16:17.720 --> 00:16:31.560
[A very thin young girl is shown outside wearing only underwear.]

00:16:31.560 --> 00:16:36.470
[Close-up of the young girl which focuses on her chest where her ribs are clearly visible.]

00:16:36.470 --> 00:16:45.140
[The girl turns her back to the camera and then turns back.]

00:16:45.140 --> 00:16:51.300
[The girl is shown from a distance again.]

00:16:51.300 --> 00:17:06.890
[The girl turns to the side.]

00:17:06.890 --> 00:17:11.030
[Boys are outside lined up to get a drink. The drinks are in a dispenser and a man is dispensing the drinks.]

00:17:11.030 --> 00:17:24.970
[One after the other the boys get drinks.]

00:17:24.970 --> 00:17:29.450
[Close-up of a boy getting his drink, which seems to be milk.]

00:17:29.450 --> 00:17:33.710
[More boys get drinks.]

00:17:33.710 --> 00:17:50.290
[Many boys are walking around outside drinking their milk.]

00:17:50.290 --> 00:18:04.280
[Boys are shown standing in a line drinking their drinks.]

00:18:04.280 --> 00:18:21.310
[Children are shown walking around outside next to a large building.]

00:18:21.310 --> 00:18:27.200
[The children are lining up in between ropes]

00:18:27.200 --> 00:18:46.920
[The children are lying down on the grass on towels. They all turn over from lying on their fronts to lying on their backs.]

00:18:46.920 --> 00:18:52.810
[Close-up of a boy's striped underwear which is torn and tied together in a knot.]

00:18:52.810 --> 00:19:00.500
[The boys are shown turning over again. There is an attendant standing among them.]

00:19:00.500 --> 00:19:06.710
[The boys are lying under strips of material which keeps the sun off their faces. There are two nurses shown standing among the boys.]

00:19:06.710 --> 00:19:18.440
[The children sit up and then turn over again.]

00:19:18.440 --> 00:19:39.360
[The front of a big building is shown with a nurse standing on the porch. The children are holding towels and come rushing out of the building and down the stairs.]

00:19:39.360 --> 00:19:47.910
[There is a nurse in the group of children who is carrying a child in her arms.]

00:19:47.910 --> 00:20:08.720
[The children are shown standing around in a grassy field.]

00:20:08.720 --> 00:20:14.080
[Boys and girls are shown standing next to their beds in a big room.]

00:20:14.080 --> 00:20:16.180
[Another room of children is shown.]

00:20:16.180 --> 00:20:19.870
[The children sit down next to their beds and then stand back up.]

00:20:19.870 --> 00:20:24.050
[The children are at the end of their beds and they turn towards the doorway where some adults have entered the room.]

00:20:24.050 --> 00:20:30.140
[The children salute the adults. There is a man accompanied by three nurses. He is looking at a chart.]

00:20:30.140 --> 00:20:36.860
[The man walks down the center aisle in between two rows of beds talking to the nurses and looking at the hands of the children.]

00:20:36.860 --> 00:20:40.540
[The adults are walking toward the camera.]

00:20:40.540 --> 00:21:42.240
[The nurses are talking to the children and looking at their hands.]

00:21:42.240 --> 00:21:53.020
[The man has his back to the camera and is talking to the children.]

00:21:53.020 --> 00:21:59.180
[The children all turn to face the camera and salute.]

00:21:59.180 --> 00:22:03.800
[The children back up along their beds and sit down in chairs.]

00:22:03.800 --> 00:22:06.860
[Another room of children is shown standing by the ends of their beds. There are girls on the left and boys on the right.]

00:22:06.860 --> 00:22:18.510
[A man and three nurses are shown walking down the middle aisle as the children salute them.]

00:22:18.510 --> 00:23:40.860
[The man and the nurses check the hands of the children.]

00:23:43.280 --> 00:23:44.320
[A boy is sitting in a chair with the sun shining on his face.]

00:23:44.520 --> 00:23:46.640
[A person mostly off camera is rubbing something on the boy's upper lip.]

00:23:46.860 --> 00:23:59.580
[Something is rubbed on the boy's fingernails and on his knee.]

00:23:59.580 --> 00:24:03.250
[An older boy is having something rubbed on the bridge of his nose. The boy stands up and leaves.]

00:24:03.250 --> 00:24:17.610
[A boy is having something rubbed on his thigh and then a bandage is applied.]

00:24:17.610 --> 00:24:32.060
[Something is applied to a boy's foot, which is then bandaged.]

00:24:32.060 --> 00:24:46.360
[A boy is being examined by a person off-camera. Something is rubbed on the boy's face and tweezers are used.]

00:24:46.600 --> 00:24:58.040
[A boy is given a shot in his hand.]

00:24:58.240 --> 00:25:15.180
[A close-up of the shot being administered is shown.]

00:25:15.190 --> 00:25:35.350
[More images of injections are shown.]

00:25:35.520 --> 00:25:47.480
[A girl shows the inside of her arms and someone off-camera points out something on her arms.]

00:25:47.490 --> 00:26:00.570
[A close-up of an arm is shown. It has a red inflamed bump on it.]

00:26:00.570 --> 00:26:18.170
[Another child has a bump or lesion on the arm.]

00:26:18.170 --> 00:26:24.250
[A boy is shown with a bump on his arm.]

00:26:24.250 --> 00:26:57.730
[Close-ups of bumps. lesions, and dark spots on the arms are shown.]

00:26:58.000 --> 00:27:04.000
[Fuzzy picture of five children holding out their arms.]

00:27:04.010 --> 00:27:18.710
[An older girl is shown in bed. She is working on a crossword puzzle and is smiling.]

00:27:18.920 --> 00:27:39.580
[Two women are shown sitting on a bed doing sewing work.]

00:27:39.580 --> 00:27:57.840
[Four girls are shown playing cards while sitting on a bed.]

00:27:57.840 --> 00:28:20.720
[Four girls are shown playing parcheesi.]

00:28:20.720 --> 00:28:57.910
[Four other girls are shown playing cards using a parcheesi board for a table.]

00:28:57.910 --> 00:29:06.240
[Someone hands one of the girls a fancy pillow that looks like a flower.]

00:29:06.240 --> 00:29:15.600
[A nurse hands a girl a thermometer. The girl is in bed in a room with other girls in bed.]

00:29:15.600 --> 00:29:26.730
[The other girls are all using thermometers also.]

00:29:26.730 --> 00:29:40.130
[The nurse walks back to the first girl and checks the reading on the thermometer. She shakes down the thermometer and records the results on a pad.]

00:29:40.130 --> 00:29:51.570
[A nurse is shown taking the pulse rate of a young girl.]

00:29:51.570 --> 00:29:56.230
[Young children are lined up outside getting drinks.]

00:29:56.230 --> 00:29:59.860
[A man is dispensing the drinks to the children.]

00:29:59.860 --> 00:30:09.610
[The long line of children is shown.]

00:30:09.610 --> 00:30:20.410
[The children are standing around drinking their drinks.]

00:30:20.600 --> 00:30:50.220
[Young boys are building a structure using logs. Three boys lift a log and hand it to other boys who are on the top of the structure.]

00:30:50.500 --> 00:31:12.360
[Two young boys are boxing while a large group of children watch them.]

00:31:12.370 --> 00:31:23.990
[Two other young boys box while the group watches.]

00:31:23.990 --> 00:31:32.130
[One boy knocks the other boy down.]

00:31:32.280 --> 00:31:51.000
[Two girls box while other boys and girls watch them. An attendant watches the match.]

00:31:51.010 --> 00:31:58.930
[Four boys are shown on two stand-up teeter-totters going up and down.]

00:31:59.140 --> 00:32:03.020
[In the background are children playing on playground equipment.]

00:32:03.240 --> 00:32:07.840
[It has a platform for people to stand on and a bar to hold on to while it spins around a pole going up and down as the weight is shifted.]

00:32:11.400 --> 00:32:24.160
[Children are sitting on the top of monkey bars while other children are going from bar to bar underneath them.]

00:32:24.170 --> 00:32:36.890
[Children in the background are swinging on swings.]

00:32:36.890 --> 00:32:42.550
[A girl hangs upside down from one of the monkey bars.]

00:32:42.550 --> 00:32:50.580
[The rest of the children hang from the bars.]

00:32:50.580 --> 00:33:07.560
[Children are playing on playground equipment.]

00:33:07.740 --> 00:33:10.160
[Children are holding boards with clay on them.]

00:33:10.400 --> 00:33:43.960
[The children have made animals and other things from the clay.]

00:33:43.960 --> 00:34:16.180
[Children are playing with a ball in a swimming pool.]

00:34:16.180 --> 00:34:22.940
[A boy and then a girl jump into the pool.]

00:34:22.940 --> 00:34:37.360
[Children are getting out of the pool and then sliding down a slide back into it.]

00:34:37.580 --> 00:34:58.020
[Children are swinging on a swingset. Some are swinging two to a seat.]

00:34:58.260 --> 00:35:35.320
[Two children are straddling a bench and playing jacks.]

00:35:35.320 --> 00:35:57.150
[Two older girls are sitting on a bench playing jacks. Another girl is sitting on the ground watching them. She then joins in the game.]

00:35:57.150 --> 00:36:04.400
[A girl in front of the bench is waving a branch around.]

00:36:04.400 --> 00:36:32.660
[There are several children sitting on the grass. One girl is stringing beads as the others watch her.]

00:36:32.940 --> 00:36:47.520
[Many people are shown outside in front of a big building. There is snow on the ground and some children are sledding.]

00:36:47.530 --> 00:37:10.960
[Many children are sledding down the hill, then walking back to the top.]

00:37:10.960 --> 00:37:21.260
[Children are rolling snow into a ball to make a snowman.]

00:37:21.260 --> 00:37:32.520
[A small group of children are having a snowball fight.]

00:37:32.520 --> 00:38:24.000
[A large group of children are having a snowball fight.]

00:38:24.240 --> 00:38:36.900
[Children are swinging on a long glider.]

00:38:37.080 --> 00:39:03.720
[Many children are playing on playgroud equipment. It has a platform for people to stand on and a bar to]

00:39:03.800 --> 00:39:18.060
[hold on to while it  spins around a pole going up and down as the weight is shifted.]

00:39:18.340 --> 00:39:37.020
[Children are swinging on a long glider. There is a boy at each end using his body weight to keep the glider going.]

00:39:37.220 --> 00:39:41.720
[An attendant is helping children to get drinks from a dispenser.] 

00:39:41.800 --> 00:39:55.640
[The man is dispensing the drinks. There are adults watching the children in the background.]

00:39:55.860 --> 00:40:15.080
[Adults are preparing food for the children.]

00:40:15.080 --> 00:40:26.400
[The children are lined up with attendants watching them.]

00:40:26.660 --> 00:41:14.320
[Camera pans across children seated on the grass, eating and drinking.]

00:41:14.320 --> 00:41:22.980
[Boys are putting pajamas on and getting into bed.]

00:41:22.980 --> 00:41:33.640
[A nurse is seated behind a table and two boys are standing next to it. The nurse is writing.]

00:41:33.640 --> 00:41:43.090
[Two nurses are standing outside talking to each other.]

00:41:43.090 --> 00:41:45.720
[One nurse walks away and we see a man in a suit.]

00:41:45.720 --> 00:41:49.780
[One nurse is shown, standing outside.]

00:41:50.000 --> 00:41:58.900
[Nurses in uniform are standing on the outside steps of a building. They have capes or coats on over their uniforms.]

00:41:58.910 --> 00:42:10.470
[A man and a woman are talking to each other.]

00:42:10.470 --> 00:42:17.550
[Four nurses are shown comng out of a building. Two of the nurses are holding hands.]

00:42:17.550 --> 00:42:23.910
[A group of nurses are talking and laughing while seated outside.]

00:42:24.120 --> 00:42:33.580
[Nurses are swinging on the swingset. Two are standing and three are seated. Another nurse is standing next a swing.]

00:42:33.840 --> 00:42:41.300
[Nurses are shown talking and laughing.]

00:42:41.300 --> 00:42:50.960
[Nurses are standing in a line with a man in a suit in the middle.]

00:42:50.960 --> 00:43:05.460
[Five nurses are gliding on the glider.]

00:43:05.740 --> 00:43:11.420
[Nurses are laughing and talking.]

00:43:11.540 --> 00:43:17.940
[One nurse is in a car and several nurses are surrounding it.]

00:43:17.940 --> 00:43:26.990
[Nurses are standing on the porch of a building and children are running down the stairs.]

00:43:26.990 --> 00:43:34.130
[Little children are standing on the lawn of a building.]

00:43:34.130 --> 00:43:46.690
[Boys and girls are shown talking to each other outside.]

00:43:46.690 --> 00:43:55.080
[Children dressed in nice clothing pose for the camera.]

00:43:55.080 --> 00:44:01.860
[Boys and girls are shown lined up on the sidewalk in a town.]

00:44:02.160 --> 00:44:10.500
[Close-up of the children on the sidewalk.]

00:44:10.740 --> 00:44:17.420
[A very large group of children is shown sitting and standing on the sidewalk in front of a large building.]

00:44:17.420 --> 00:44:21.520
[A bus backs up in front of the group.]

00:44:21.520 --> 00:44:34.540
[The children start to board the bus.]

00:44:34.820 --> 00:44:43.820
[The bus is filled with children.]

00:44:43.820 --> 00:44:50.260
[Older girls are shown boarding the bus under the direction of the nurses.]

00:44:50.480 --> 00:44:57.500
[Older boys are on the street.]

00:44:57.510 --> 00:45:06.210
[Girls are milling about on the street.]

00:45:06.210 --> 00:45:17.450
[More children board a bus. Several buses are on the street.]

00:45:17.700 --> 00:45:29.040
[Nurses are dishing out food from large pots.]

00:45:29.300 --> 00:45:40.060
[Children are seated on the lawn eating. Several children wave at the camera.]

00:45:40.280 --> 00:45:45.960
[Long camera view of the children marching as if in a parade. The children are divided into groups.]

00:45:46.180 --> 00:46:07.600
[Some children make a sharp right turn.]

00:46:07.860 --> 00:46:23.100
The groups continue marching.

00:46:23.380 --> 00:46:41.100
[The children are shown saluting an American flag that is being lowered.]

00:46:41.340 --> 00:46:55.960
[The flag is lowered to the bottom of the pole and is being held by someone.]

00:46:55.960 --> 00:47:23.680
[Several children are holding the flag and folding it.]

00:47:23.920 --> 00:47:30.540
[A truck with children riding in the back is shown. There are nurses and an attendant standing by the truck.]

00:47:30.740 --> 00:47:33.500
[The truck leaves and some of the children wave to the camera.]

00:47:33.500 --> 00:47:58.620
[Another truck is backed up to the stairs of a large building. Children are being loaded into the truck as an attendant oversees the loading.]

00:47:58.820 --> 00:48:05.020
[Another truck loaded with people drives away. Some people wave at the camera.]

00:48:05.030 --> 00:48:20.230
[Children are being loaded onto a train with the help of a nurse. Some of the children have suitcases or traveling bags.]

00:48:20.520 --> 00:48:25.760
[The film ends abruptly.]

